{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1515,
  "batch_count": 1701,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "624b11ee6bac4894f9e1bac15c5037fc7d787286",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f28ea412aa39baa28c365800",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一如往常，\r\n我只需要将训练累积的\r\n实力都发挥出来就行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c026b5337d0dfb5c9ba9d320ae1c62f6c4c7f9970807ee8cf0a4cc1b12518d1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f459b7e73b5d75e232c2777",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，差不多快轮到我出场了吧。\r\n那么，我上场了唷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "633f2e714f4e5fb0b66ba1da607a2054d91da40f31d761e1d0c42b151512aa71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89272f208e46cc2d0e26e5b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不太会紧张耶～\r\n毕竟该做的事情，我都尽力去做了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d42c76b84705adb568230f4e4f4657a4393b3071cead257f4c71de9535a9255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e32d16506cc5e71ef46a26a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坦白讲，我的状态不太好～\r\n不过，我必须坚持到最后，\r\n拿下胜利才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "114889834336e6648103e8dcdf308de279e50c8019172067fc5be3344bc84a84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:284e8bbb7cfdc48c4a8c8a4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然状态实在称不上好……\r\n但正因为如此，\r\n才更要绷紧神经面对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34c6493c9b4b9b8e6b42633f1549f1102bfa2bad95d1502d9504a43390f996f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d04109000f72c8ee44b1c834",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坚持到底是我的长处，\r\n努力朝胜利迈进吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ed005bb1cd41f947cb660ac43f4a99d12f4f7a7bbce644e357ef97581a8d8d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8991780ff570685a1ed114e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然状态不佳……\r\n但竞赛的世界就是如此。\r\n我会拿出全力，绝不心存侥幸的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a925d864d1c53d245ecd9fa3c2d492ff2f88abdf81b2a44f37c8051fa4718d75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c2411f39fb4c364435d583c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了好了，\r\n本来就不可能事事顺利。\r\n现在只能尽力而为了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "009e5f02cec918fba537c66ad45594f2e20a27de510fbf115bf447ab178108aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf5f2e66006bd13fbf0dcbd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了……无论状态如何，\r\n都只能尽全力奔跑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63d5e959ba060b1f6be00ce0eb49e1a66fa5df736c83a9b66a2d1b9b9c57cfc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1881cabc93de29123abed91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8ac2b92626bc0ee3fe94eb2306a0ca43e845e47f2640cac63e477fccbc0cd7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3312896990a43c44d54bd605",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看我的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "503ea01d77a7f82f77b9ee6777a86a4285a4d4da03480f36106ce31bfeb1d59f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:706f31a28d9d217fd8658da9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿咻～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e730867d21ab965fbdb56902425110794664466bf5e3a29d2b7426b9a2b0d3fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8336d2e344eb6b8654982307",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "bae68a8b2b8162e04831e0e516100be08d54d4f8ed8f914126b4d922a5806ee7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56bf0cd45a881387d648b18f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f648cc071d9b560d6eaf438e418b83e701f2beac7368232313cd73d3367099ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08b4a219a88f9fe6252c1454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b9c4953ab77964dbc5cd56b37bfe1a0df549263759f088f595dae547ba6bdb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c6066640cd38bfeedbed502",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b52ec6a51ea86f04e77eb47b539df83710d70ffb623152a29d619d493402def",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9017a05b53328cb0a584b212",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很漂亮呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9de05c435403069571151c5e2c53526650698e25d9c59197729c3a27c802b69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c65831a549a0900d85bcbc46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受你诸多照顾了……谢谢你啰～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdcf5bf042789515349321745d652446665602cdfdb4762f8f8093fe885cb054",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63d9dfed5a0625734bc028f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也辛苦了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "061a18631a01933c013125c416897eb46aeee462d9ad560ae5b281f8e8871937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86f5df0685313f7261026216",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来～吧，要拿出干劲上啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8773b3ef5b1cc2743e29d210f8ffc26387b8db6ef1d2828c93e59c4e2c9a598",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14b08d78a83d72dae25827a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力以赴吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eaa6d4664a6a948d48352e7d645b17447ba029312ed3cf534ee9622c4a51e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c3ffc517a43011062381207",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坚持到最后一刻吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d84ffbc472a10c365833521efb90e60df82e01f27c39bc4327ced2069d9131a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88db9a67c47d2ee200eb7814",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也辛苦了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "061a18631a01933c013125c416897eb46aeee462d9ad560ae5b281f8e8871937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efb4d8db1da4843196fbed31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态非常完美唷。\r\n而且我事先有吃萝卜的脆脆腌菜，\r\n把肚子填得饱饱的了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29995a3cf233d9ba019fff06a52500b2301da5549936e393f28869a49334951b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3345b8b07bd367686c72624b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要不放弃就一定能获得回报，\r\n我得向大家证明这点才行呢。\r\n拿出干劲上场吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfe31ffa69084d2ec10f2752b3659678bf4d46d2ab6588ab1c4d7aafa314d6ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddf3d8e0aba80d7eba44e2bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也辛苦了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "061a18631a01933c013125c416897eb46aeee462d9ad560ae5b281f8e8871937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3afce5dd2d399f6547c97152",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そぉ～れ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b0af0e609d48612e5f4280de4bc02c60aa6c4492163b538ebd30b503a46d3fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e8e075e0dee066b38457089",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还差一点……\r\n就只差一点了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f428c96603e7bd74ecfb5294683d98ae9307f4a10c47a4520ce9bdbc821c3ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89a35187049f1bcb329d92aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还没结束呢，下次一定要赢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e6933a45c826bb3ad57480df8b5cf85a25b3268b25693a0b90aa7b6dcd3ddc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38d9bcf4734f61a9b49817a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不甘心……必须继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28d448252d5c0adff8bab4eb6cfe6df4fcde0470bec3e87b92a7eee92a91f166",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75139694c71c699385e40d21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……必须重新打起精神才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "046abaef32811ea96db69e3ab7f072e07d1af4bc58ed293cb18fe29fca578033",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0306a1305cc48280ddb5a9c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坚持终将获胜～就是这个意思吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbdb024a7f26dd3166ba30705d935a22f4fb6474251a7bb88a2da262ea2cce23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2829a748b9ad3110e3c8e1da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你看见希望之光了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1dc1b6f602b0ec51497ad6a415d11e586185337d82608d2da40db11881f95c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6a5ec00e8af937251061a6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，去拿下胜利吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "997d6dd3b59c9e2815ebe8d325db8ca82390f11863d72fb763eff224d0a3242d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a64f1ad8be9bcd294c0bd48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收获的时刻到啰～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bdd62f140b0261b3e91e715c60bf0d0d68541818b4a6488e38aad1f254a3c20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cf4f0deb2a8a2b245a22be8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去年はトランさんも“へす”に\r\n出たんですって。今年はお客さん\r\nとして来てくれるそうよ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dc56ac7ea4778becccda67a31bb85038013b8f1192d63330df440fc324e670f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56303f5f2cbee1c4ceb3c387",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まったく同じことはできないけど…\r\nあたしもタルマエちゃんを見習って\r\n少しはしゃんとせねばねぇ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3de01877a165cc5c16a1edc485ad6b061727a662daf2d2c33d4acefd3e76be14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:701666a02f70ca5ab0583a61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一点一滴、慢慢地……好好长大……\r\n成为不会输给任何人的大树吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6d9b23074602a05c957fe5ed67f35a3978154cb12d0a659af1e2df80c127ce4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61ba1ec29e4711a5c123c286",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いべんとみっしょん？あぁ、\r\nハンコを押してもらえるの。\r\nあらご褒美まで？いいわね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bff1d4044538e055ef8b546d01d7bd7ea771e2d79e3299d8972ed0032a9dcc4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b4d6133290427752da09c43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あらまあ、ご褒美は\r\n忘れずにもらって帰らないと。\r\nいいお土産になるねぇ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "215fc2b7896e1f85ae22bb13a55b2a61dda31c66544c720e7ba2cb5d3545ffdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de332cf216123dcd58b28703",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行きましょう",
      "source_fingerprint": "70a191aefe00a78f59cfff8efee58ddfee9f530d2660399a27d71b5058cf6121",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17cb0652c6c969e8a2cef581",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やったねぇ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b922b621472f4c83ad6e1d441c5962ae867380b6994026eefd062fbf5062f846",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c836d9eeea09fff734c8da1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よぉし",
      "source_fingerprint": "8962088c9a53ad4e49e8ae554ff5674255d79bf13f5395cba64a36ef730f1e66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
