      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a6ae998502cfb78d5a3c146",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯，努力完成任务的好孩子，\r\n可以拿到奖励喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7961ec84005e0a03b47698a270f5443754db07c877a924512585964b3cdc2e4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "80003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dbbbd21a8f6881655a20e1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お互い、ベストを\r\n尽くしましょうねぇ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3914072f21f991df60edcc4e1903fff4462c0c0affeb6f4faf565af9a046885b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:535c122f0a97626796a9f438",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はりゃあ～、強いねぇ。\r\nだけどあたしも負けないよぉ。\r\n真っ向勝負、楽しみじゃ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60e857b20d57079482be3683cf385783f2b2bc68bf35c3c08bfb53ef013149dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4335c2fa18e0c9ca3b9c382b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安。你吃早餐了吗？\r\n我推荐吃纳豆饭，\r\n那对身体很好喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d728d4734c1ee147868818853972e7a9684ab1cdaacdb3ae3b7b3c6e7905d25b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e87b8b6f17a107cb6f8b976",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，你看起来好像很困呢～\r\n我给你一颗糖果提神吧。\r\n是清凉的薄荷口味喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "53972498967bbb74ebc2572344508913186a95fca6b3ad0c06eeef61681563f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3728316179d0985645bf0ab3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小历经常在午餐时间告诉我\r\n有哪些「开运菜色」，\r\n让我学到了很多呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53bfdddfc8918c54a669141249477d6992f69ebce14a690d1dad69090807075b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b3d76ddcebc150cf1e0ef24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很努力工作呢～\r\n要不要吃点饼干当点心？\r\n这样下午就能充满精神地训练了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac77556f556e2c6299c9f93561bffde13136f5248d5647ebf2849dbe02c1126c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79d52a3c8b2334e5f9e58a14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你晚上会不会听见不晓得\r\n从哪里传来的奇妙声音呢？\r\n那说不定是鵺呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e48c4808c5fa7152d87120c4fe2a304241a76d80da9a956c66eec84987724ac9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1100",
